WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:04.629
Young Max, one more offense,
and you'll be behind bars.

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:06.381
Flora, you're his mother…

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.049
Find him something to do.

00:00:09.217 --> 00:00:10.301
What are you doing right now?

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:12.262
You don't want to know.

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:15.140
You are a great mother.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.015
Am I?

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:17.350
Happy birthday.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.060
- What's that?
- It's yours.

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:21.563
Don't want to play.
Since when am I a guitarist?

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.481
I can't go on like this,

00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:25.859
living in a shoebox
with a kid who hates me.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:27.861
Can't wait for the day
I don't have to be here.

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.904
Go on!
Go back to your dad!

00:00:29.904 --> 00:00:31.698
I might learn the guitar myself.

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:32.657
That's just too funny.

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:34.993
Takes years of practice,
commitment.

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:38.413
Are you really gonna talk to me
about commitment?

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:44.919
We're ready to teach you
how to shred the gnar on guitar.

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:48.298
So, you wanna learn the guitar.

00:00:48.298 --> 00:00:50.550
This is a gift you can
take to your grave.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.594
- What's your problem?
- I didn't know I had a problem.

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:54.888
You're teaching guitar
online, Love.

00:00:55.763 --> 00:00:56.973
What are you hoping
to get out of this?

00:00:56.973 --> 00:00:57.932
I thought this guitar

00:00:57.932 --> 00:00:59.350
might make my son
think I'm cool.

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:01.352
- I'll be back in an hour!
- I don't care.

00:01:01.352 --> 00:01:03.229
- How annoying is he?
- Very annoying.

00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:05.106
- What is that?
- Shh.

00:01:05.773 --> 00:01:08.067
Jesus Christ,
it's like a club in here!

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:09.319
Turn it down a second!

00:01:10.111 --> 00:01:11.029
Was that yours?

00:01:11.779 --> 00:01:13.615
How did you make that?
It sounded epic.

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:15.533
♪ Come on girl, let's get in trouble ♪

00:01:15.533 --> 00:01:17.702
♪ Shaken, not stirred
A James Bond from Dublin ♪

00:01:17.702 --> 00:01:20.580
♪ We got something real ♪

00:01:21.122 --> 00:01:22.248
Why don't you ask her out?

00:01:22.832 --> 00:01:23.708
Can I try that on?

00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:25.210
- It's too big.
- That's the look.

00:01:26.336 --> 00:01:27.754
Yeah, for turtles.

00:01:29.631 --> 00:01:30.965
She's totally
out of my league.

00:01:30.965 --> 00:01:32.008
Let's write a song.

00:01:32.008 --> 00:01:33.384
She has to hear your passion.

00:01:33.384 --> 00:01:34.511
Express yourself.

00:01:36.346 --> 00:01:37.514
She hated it.

00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:39.182
Yo, just get out of my way,
woman.

00:01:39.682 --> 00:01:40.517
Gladly!

00:01:43.561 --> 00:01:46.147
I was 17 with a
screaming child on my lap.

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:48.274
This can't be my story.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:51.694
But, without him,
I have nothing.

00:01:51.694 --> 00:01:53.613
♪

00:01:53.696 --> 00:01:56.699
How come the way things are
are never enough for you?

00:01:56.699 --> 00:01:58.660
♪

00:01:58.660 --> 00:01:59.744
They never were.

00:01:59.744 --> 00:02:01.829
♪

00:02:07.585 --> 00:02:10.255
Playing the guitar…
it's so sexy.

00:02:10.505 --> 00:02:11.464
Okay.

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:12.423
Is that why you took it up?

00:02:12.423 --> 00:02:13.508
Let's focus on you.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:15.551
Are you coming on to me?

00:02:16.761 --> 00:02:19.430
♪

